<Shell title="Be part of the story" active="contribute"><div class="wrap"><div class="page-head"><p class="eyebrow">An invitation to contribute</p><h1>What do you know<br/>that we should know?</h1><p class="lead">A place remembered. A photograph with a story. A better source. Every thoughtful contribution can deepen the record.</p></div><div class="prose section" style="padding-top:0"><p class="notice">Contribution channels are being prepared. This preview does not collect submissions or upload files yet.</p><h2>Share knowledge</h2><p>Help document a place, a person, a craft or a local word. Tell us how you know it and include sources where available. Personal recollections are welcome as recollections, rather than presented as established historical fact.</p><h2>Share photographs</h2><p>Prepare a caption, location, approximate date and the credit you would like used. Share only images you have permission to offer. The planned first photo route is editorial email review; an address will be provided when it is ready.</p><h2>Improve an entry</h2><p>Keep the entry’s title, the suggested correction and a supporting source together. Approved Git contributors will also be able to propose changes through the repository.</p><h2>What happens next?</h2><p>Editors will review submissions, clarify attribution and permissions, and decide what is ready to publish. Sending material will not make it public automatically.</p><a class="text-link" href="/explore/">Explore what we’re building ↗</a></div></div></Shell>
